From c535dd57addb56e6370cca066f93a5e818489eb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:54:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Player: simplified to back, share, play, the cue and the
 scrubber
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Figma Changes → Player (16906:5328), every design version, staging and
production (owner's request). The coin pill, the 15-second skips and the
session-details sheet under the player are gone; the cue sits under the
play button and the scrubber alone at the foot; Share opens the share
sheet in every version and is a rounded square like Back. How a session
went is now asked by the daily check-in. RELEASES.simplePlayer, true on
both sites.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
---
 src/pages/PlayerPage.tsx | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++----------
 src/versions/releases.ts |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

